"I'm not sure when&nbsp;I wrote this, I think&nbsp;it was about two weeks ago. Anyway,&nbsp;I just thought&nbsp;I would share it (if anyone reads this thing...Please comment!)&nbsp;instead of letting it rot in Word... these are just sayings that I like and thoughts&nbsp;I came up with about myself. (hence the title) -When I commit to something I always do my best -I am a perfectionist, but I am not perfect -Although I aim to please, it does not mean my good wishes are false -On the contrary, I am very honest -Although I am shy, that doesn't mean I don't want to be asked questions -Just because I'm quiet doesn't mean I don't have anything to say -I may be innocent but that doesn't mean I'm ignorant -Although I want to please, it doesn't mean I will give in -I will stick up for what I believe in -I may be soft, but I am not easy -Just because I chose to be kind and give of myself&nbsp;to many people does not mean my offerings should be valued any less -I may voluntarily sacrifice myself for others but that does not mean I don't feel pain -Ask, and you shall receive -Just because I don't know what to say doesn't mean I don't understand -I get anxious when I am alone but that does not mean I always want company -I care what other people think, but that does not mean I am not myself -I give because it makes me happy, because I want to help, because&nbsp;I care and&nbsp;because I think it's the right thing to do but that doesn't mean I&nbsp;don't want&nbsp;something in return - I don't give to recieve but that doesn't mean you should take my actions for granted - I do not need your approval or appreciation to make my&nbsp;giving worthwhile, but that doesn't mean it doesn't hurt when I'm ignored (when&nbsp;my actions arn't apprecitated or reciprocated) -Just because I'm quiet doesn't mean I don't have feelings -Just because I'm shy doesn't mean I can't be passionate -Just because I serve others, doesn't mean I am weak -I am stronger than I look -Somebody has to take the fall, it mind as well be me -Helping others is a proud and noble job -Just because I say I'm okay doesn't mean I am -I will tell you if it's important -I avoid conflict but that doesn't mean I'm scared -I don't like arguments but silence is worse -Just because I forgive, doesn't mean I forget -I believe these three words (or concepts) are at the root of who I am and are very much involved in why I do (and say) what I do: -Perfectionism (need to succeed and do my best, always) -Generosity (need to help people and give back to those who have helped me) -Self-consciousness (need to be accepted, wanted and loved)",0,normal,blog_corpus,752072.female.17.indUnk.Scorpio,,,,,,0
