"A friend is someone who will bail you out of jail. A best friend is the one sitting beside you saying, 'Damn that was fun. True friends are the siblings God forgot to give us.The best friend you can have is one you can sit on the porch with and not say a word, then get up and feel like that was the best conversation you've ever had. I'll always be beside you until the very end, wiping all your tears away, being your best friend. I'll smile when you smile and feel all the pain you do, and if you cry a single tear, I promise I'll cry too. I asked God for a flower, and He gave me a garden. I asked Him for a tree amd He gave me a forest. I asked Him for a river and He gave me an ocean. I asked God for a friend and He gave me..""JANIECE"" Friends can help each other. A true friend is someone who lets you have total freedom to be yourself--and especially to feel, or not feel. Whatever you happen to be feeling at the moment is fine with them. That's what real love amounts to--letting a person be what they really are."" A true friend is someone who reaches for your hand and touches your heart. If you haven't already made me what I am, you've made me what I'll be! How long we will be friends?Let me see....as long as stars twinkle in the sky...as long as angels are there up high...'til oceans run dry...and 'til the day I die. We weren't born sisters at birth but fate knew from the start we were meant to be sisters by heart. A good friend is like a computer: she Enters your life, Saves you in his heart, Formats your problems, and never Deletes you from her Memory. I was able to walk on fire, I was able to climb the highest mountain, I was able to perform the most impossible tasks, only because through every hard trial, you were there holding my hand. 'Cause you truly are my special friends. You will always be my best friend, you know too much. heehee. The miracle of friendship speaks from one heart to another, listens for unspoken needs, recognizes secret dreams, and understands the silent things. This is a message from me to you, to make sure you never forget I love you! When things are rough and you feel lost, just call on me and I'll be there at any cost. I'll do this because I care for you, I'll stick by your side no matter what you do. I am your friend through thick and thin, just as, for me, you have always been. A true friend is always be there when the whole world left you, she always cheers you up when the whole world has turned you down and she never asks you to act like an angel but she becomes your angel. If you're upset, call me. I won't guarentee I'll make you laugh but I can cry with you. If you ever feel like you need to run away, call me. I won't guarentee I'll persuade you to stay but I can run with you. But, if one day you call and there's no answer....I might need you. A friend comforts you when you are down, supports you when you struggle, and celebrates when you succeed. But a BEST friend feels pain when you are hurt and holds you as you cry together, walks with you every step as you struggle, and rejoices with you at every success. Nations will rise and fall. Wars will be lost and won. Lives will begin and end, but a true friend is eternal. Memories last forever, never do they die. Friends stay together, never say goodbye. A friend is a crutch when you're falling apart; a friend is a pillar when you have a broken heart. A friend is a treasure without knowing why; a friend holds you together and won't let you cry. Friendship opens many doors, each with a different view, but none could be more welcome than the door that leads to you. What is a friend? A friend is two people sharing one soul. And that friend is you Janiece. FRIENDS FOREVER!!!!!!!!! joylee",0,normal,blog_corpus,3977718.female.43.indUnk.Libra,,,,,,0
"This is strange, very very strange...thank you, Abe or Ursula or whoever, but... Now: The Moment Of Truth Disclaimer: I can't believe I didn't think of this before, but it's not exactly my idea. I mean, I hadn't thought of this guy until a few months ago, when I read On Your Mark, but I didn't get the idea of him being the Prince until like seven seconds ago. So, here you are: MARK EVANS!!!!!!!!!!! Of course! It's so simple, really I should have thought of him beofre. It just came to me, when I was commenting on a comment on a comment on a comment on something I said about Dean. Do you remember Mark? He's all new, he was only mentioned once in OotP. The guy who cheeked Big D? He was beaten up? But he's got the same last name as Lily, so he could be like one of Harry's long-lost cousins. He could even be illigit, so Dumbledore wouldn't know, maybe, and he could be half blood, probably would be if he's related to Lily, she's Muggleborn, and...I cannot believe I didn't think of this earlier.",0,normal,blog_corpus,3184805.male.14.Biotech.Pisces,,,,,,0
