"I drink about 4-5 litres of water a day. This makes me pee every 10-15 minutes. I am becoming the master of the one-handed hold and shake as I take my water bottle in with me. Should I be writing more than a diary. Should I start a story and write it every thursday? Should I wax poetic about secret longings and potential viking-like conquests? I surely do not want to be writing about pee and weight and water all the time. Maybe just observations then. Like when my orange knap sack hit a woman in the head on the subway and I thought she might say something, but then looked at her and knew she would not. She was not the brave type. Although I swear I could read her mind as if she had closed captioning on her parking lot sized forehead. A friend came over last night. He brought a toy for my son. It was a nice gesture and after almost 20 years we still find a comfortable level of conversation. It was nice to see him, even if he did make out with my wife years ago. I had a popsicle last night and it was good. A blue one, just like Hud's.",0,normal,blog_corpus,4137692.male.34.BusinessServices.Libra,,,,,,0
