"I got to go home early from work today!!! :) 7:30 to be precise. When I was told I could leave early if I wanted to they didn;t have to tell me twice. LOL! I am now officially starting my much deserved and payed 4 days off. I have the concert on Sunday night, and I am going back to the fair Monday and not sure what I'm going to do for tuesday or Thursday, but I know it won't be work. Don't get me wrong, I love my job but it's always nice to get away for a while. I had to train a new person today. While I don't mind doing that, It does get frustrating, as you have to slow down, go at their pace and keep remembering that they are new and that you once was also and have lots and lots of patience. I think he is going to work out fine as he is catching onto everthing really quickly. He just needs to have some self confidancee that he can do it by himself and do it correctly. I told him this afternoon that we all make mistakes but that is how we learn. He will do fine. He is closing tonight and I ahve shown him how a dozen or so times and the Mananger is there to help him should he have trouble. Either way, i'll hear about it on Thursday.",0,normal,blog_corpus,4008222.female.41.indUnk.Sagittarius,,,,,,0
