"Oh my God I have a job offer. Going off of my dating experience, I figured that three weeks without a call back was probably a bad sign, so when they did call me yesterday I was pretty shocked. In all truthfulness, I wish they hadn't called back, because then I wouldn't be faced with this dilemma. It's a great job, working with great people, with a great company...in the shittiest town known to man. Even my other shitty-town prospect is better than this one, since The Boy will potentially be in that Shitty Town. And I know the whole point of keeping The Thing with The Boy low key was to keep me nice and independent so I could go wherever I want...but that freedom was supposed to allow me to go to Seattle or San Francisco or Berlin, not Shittiest-Town-Known-To-Man, USA. Surely I like him more than that. I have absolutely no idea what I'm going to do. Yesterday I was going to turn them down, today I'm thinking of accepting, so who knows what I'll say on Friday when they need an answer.",0,normal,blog_corpus,1549103.female.23.Technology.Taurus,,,,,,0
