"It's summer and I'm lovin it. This summer is going to include 2 major things. Katlyn and Golf. I'll be spending the whole with Katlyn or golfing, and maybe I can get her to come golfing with me so I can have the best of both worlds. That would be neat. Hopefully I'll lose some weight over the summer too so i can be skinny. WooHoo! Grandparents are leaving today so I can have my room back! YAY! I enjoyed having them here so it's all good. I'll be glad to have my bed back so I can get off the floor. That's all for now, posts may be few and far between during the summer, but I'll try to keep you updated. I Love You Katlyn!",0,normal,blog_corpus,3390239.male.14.indUnk.Libra,,,,,,0
