s soooooooooooooo happy. http://www.epinions.com/auto_Make-1998_BMW_M3 Its that exact car...black. Four Doors are rare..but she got it. Furthermore, she may let me take it to my interview. :-DDDD",0,normal,blog_corpus,3883466.male.16.indUnk.Capricorn,,,,,,0
