f Lot 1. When i took the MRT back and reached my station, by some luck my frenz called me to apologize and those who noe me, i always forgive and forget. So, wif me calmed down, i went back to Lot 1 and met them. Of course when i met them i tried not to show that i was angry so i resumed my good mood, it eventually became good anyway. We had lunch.. A big lunch if i might add. But since i was already tired.. i was then ready to return home.. Peace Man!",0,normal,blog_corpus,3504220.male.15.indUnk.Aries,,,,,,0
