"when i must give a second thought, a re-thought to everything that i have already thought. dreams are rather worthless without a fight, and so our thoughts and ideas. i lived today wondering what i have really been doing what i have really done with my life thus far. not a long life, but then i wasn't born with a contract and termination date, all i know is that there will be a one and i can't possibly spend my time feeling terribly unhappy, when there is so little of it anyways. i spent some time away from the computer this weekend, more than i usually spend away, i needed it. i looked at picture after picture wondering what it all meant, wondering where my hope would come from or how i could transform it into reality. i think the time away helped actually. i listened to Bach (my meditation music) and felt at peace and then i watched far too much tv, probably enough to enduce one bad headache. about dreams, mine sometimes don't touch reality, i won't even let them, there is no fear if they only live inside of me, but i cannot continue like this. life is about being real, not about what is strictly in my head. i have to allow it to develop, i must fight for things, i must regain my energy, i must not allow the way things are to continue. and certainly, fear is not an emotion that can be a guiding light, i can't allow myself to forget, myself, or others. so i sigh and take a deep breath and understand things again, or at least try to understand them once. and then i wonder why i can't sleep at night, or at least not properly. but the hours add up. 5 instead of 8, and 5 instead of 8 again, time to sleep more than usual.",0,normal,blog_corpus,3764815.female.17.indUnk.Cancer,,,,,,0
