"What is this? Ronald McDonald is here. So is the Burger King and the Jack in the Box. Arby as well. What now. I realize it is Wendy's birthday. I will die here if i don't leave. But if I leave the clan will kill me. I go to bathroom. Wait for the first foe to come through door. Slice! Shoom! Tack, Tack, Tack(shuriken)! I have just slain Ronald McDonald. I look at the floor and see the furry wig and fuzzy red nose. I know now my mistake and what I must do. I walk out door and became surrounded by kids. Why, because now I am Ronald McDonald. Wendy see's that it is not the right Ronald. She beckons me to her side. You are not Ronald! White 99 cent value meal ninjas arise! I am surrounded. Hope is not lost. The lowly Arby comes to aid. Curly Fry Gunslingers jumped through the doors. The ninja's flee and take my beloved Wendy with them. I thank Arby, and give chase. Right then and there my dark clan's power rose up in me. Dark Dragon Yogurt Parfait Wave! Wendy was blown back to my arms, as the ninjas flew up into the air on the wings of the Parfait. Wendy then sees what I have done and knows that i am the ninja for her. The End",0,normal,blog_corpus,3634174.male.17.indUnk.Aquarius,,,,,,0
