"It's Great Being A Bloke 1. A five-day holiday requires one overnight bag 2. Phone conversations are over in 30 seconds flat 3. Queues for the bathroom don't exist 4. You can open all your own jars 5. When clicking through the channels you don't have to stall at every one where someone's crying 6. All your orgasms are real 7. You don't have to lug a bag of useless stuff around 8. You can go to the bathroom without a support group 9. When your work is criticised, you understand that everyone doesn't secretly hate you 10. You get extra credit for the slightest act of thoughtfulness 11. Nobody wonders if you swallow 12. You never have to clean a toilet 13. You can be showered and ready to go in 10 minutes 14. You save time and money by washing up in bulk every third week 15. Sex means never worrying about your reputation 16. Wedding plans take care of themselves 17 If someone forgets to invite you to something, it means that they forgot to invite you. It doesn't mean that they hate you, and he or she can still be your friend 18. You don't have to shave below your neck 19. None of your co-workers have the power to make you cry 20. You don't have to curl up next to a hairy backside every night 21. If you're 45 and single, nobody even notices 22. You can write your name in the snow 23. Biological clock? 24. Chocolate is just another snack 25. Flowers fix everything 26. You never have to worry about other people's feelings 27. You get to think about sex 90% of your waking hours 28. Reverse parking is easy 29. Foreplay is optional 30. Window-shopping is what you do when you buy windows 31. Robbie Williams does not exist in your universe 32. You don't have to clean your house if the meter reader's coming 33. You never feel compelled to stop a pal from getting laid. In fact you encouragethem. 34. Car mechanics tell you the truth 35. You don't give a rat's ass if no one notices your new haircut 36. You can quietly watch a game on TV with a buddy for hours without ever thinking he's mad at you. 37. You never look at the size of a baby's head and cringe 38. The whole world is your urinal 39. Hot wax never comes near your pubic area 40. One mood, all the time 41. Same work, more pay! 42. Grey hair and wrinkles add character 43. The remote control is yours and yours alone 44. No such thing as bunny-hopping half an inch above the toilet seat 45. People never glance at your chest when you're talking to them 46. You have a normal and healthy relationship with your mother 47. You can buy condoms without the shopkeeper imagining you naked 48. If you don't call your buddy when you say you will, he won't tell your other friends and they, won't try and work out what the problem is 49. Someday you'll be a dirty old man. And you're looking forward to it 50. You never have to miss a sexual opportunity because you're not in the mood 51. Dieting involves getting regular sized fries with your burger 52. Porn movies are designed specifically with your mind in mind 53. You don't have to remember everyone's birthdays and anniversaries 54. Not liking a person doesn't exclude having great sex with them 55. Your pals can be trusted never to trap you with: ""so... notice anything different?"" 56. Your mates never say, ""Well if you don't know what you did wrong, I'm certainly not telling you."" 57. Your mates never say ""Talk to me"" 58. Life will go on if the bedsheets don't get changed once in a while. 59. Having a beer belly is a perfect reason for wearing a T-shirt.",0,normal,blog_corpus,4241583.male.48.HumanResources.Aquarius,,,,,,0
"Ok, so, I guess I should update all of you who are just dying to know what is going on in my life (ok, so I am being sarcastic, so shoot me The last time I updated this was the night of the concert that really sucked. So I won't write about that except to say that it....really sucked, so there ya go. Saturday....oh what a night...haha! It was sooo fun! It kinda sucked at first because we had lawn tickets. We snuck up to the front but we were caught and almost kicked out of Smirnoff...but oh well. The Riddlin' Kids rocked....again! They get better and better each time you see them play live. MxPx had some mad mosh pits going on that I was a part of. Talk about getting a work-out. And talk about the hot sweaty, shirtless guys that kindly help you up when you fall down...heh, good times, good times...the music was amazing during the first two I mentioned, Good Charlotte, and New Found Glory. Excellent stuff, let me tell ya. I mean, wow! Sigh, that night will live in infamy...so much fun...except for the part where some ppl stole our stuff. I lost a poster, Olivia lost her t-shirt. Sunday morning when I woke up, I felt like a ton of bricks had hit my head, so I slept through church. Oops. Then I went to work. I came home and worked on my gay English project until 2:30 and then went to bed. I woke up late and still had to print out some stuff but my brother had screwed up my mom's computer so my mom told me to just drive myself to school so I go outside and....our car is missing!!!! So I was late that morning and my teacher STILL made me get a tardy pass even though I explained to her that I didn't have a FREAKIN CAR to get to school!!! They have no emotions, I'm telling you. Well, I told everyone at school that our car was stolen and they were all like, ""Wow"" Well, I get home to find out that it was gone because my mom hadn't paid some money on it and so they towed it. Now, we have to move to a cheaper house because my mom has to use her tax return to pay to get her car back rather than pay her property tax...I have such good role models for parents... :) Today, I did not really have a good day, but I am trying to remain positive so I'll just leave you with that I am extremely tired and have been so for a while now...seriously....I am so tired. I need sleep. Well, I must go now and sleep! Lisa",0,normal,blog_corpus,1234631.female.17.indUnk.Aquarius,,,,,,0
"Spread wide oh man, good times were had yesterday at church..... Let see the lady next to us like yelled at me because I my palm fell on the floor and I didn't pick it up (WTF) and just went crazy with Britt and Dorothy. LETS DO A LITTLE ANALYZING (remember this is a church song) Your love is extravagant Your friendship, is intimate (now I don't know about you but when I hear intimate I think sex...) I feel like moving to the rhythm of your grace Your fragrance is intoxicating, in our secret place (intoxicating? Once again negative connotation and ""secret place"" WOW!!!) Spread wide in the arms of Christ , is the love that covers sin. (ep) No greater love have I ever known; You considered me your friend. Capture my heart again. Which reminds me, anyone remember that zipper song from church.... yeah I think I have the lyrics somewhere, I'll have to find them... I don't feel like talking about this weekend at all because I am just too lazy so here's a quick outline Friday- babysat Saturday- soccer meeting- Britt downtown- family party w. britt (aka her staring at my cousin)- downtown to concert- dorothys-ryans- spencers-home Sunday- concert with my dad- church- target with Dorothy- my house with Dorothy- britt came over- sleep Period sum ups: 1st- it's official Mr. Kabat is a communist 2nd- Mr. kabat is a communist and I got 100% on the quiz! 3rd- listened to Allison talk about her boyfriend and how they are going to the wrapped tour (jealous) 4th- got some homework done and gave Chris the answers to the quiz in English 5th- I actually worked!! Ok so it was for half the period and all we did was take pictures but still, read britts journal and then went and visited her and Morgan 6th- stared at Mr. B's cool screen saver then started reading the hella confusing packet on cloning or something Soccer practice tonight and I need to get a bathing suit because I leave for HAWAII on Friday!!!!!!!! Oh man............ quote of the day: ""she had car troubles this weekend"" ""Meaning my cousin got high and backed into my car"" *oh man I love our lunch table* Music that fits my mood: tipsy Today I heart with all my heart: I don't even know",0,normal,blog_corpus,1627994.female.17.indUnk.Virgo,,,,,,0
