We are in the pooh mate! That was a quip made by the character Porter Ricks in the movie Flipper. Today at 2:00 EST that was an applicable phrase for me. I really enjoy my job most of the time but today was on the nasty side. We had a sewer pipe back blow up from the drain in a bathroom floor. When I fist came to check out a complaint of a bad smell I found hunks of poop every where! The smell was worse than my relatives pig farm. I quickly doned my protective gear and started scooping it up. I had done this in a figurative way at my last staff position but today I was doing it in all of it's full sensory glory. The best part of the story was when I went to go tell my boss he was going to have to call in Roto Rooter he was escorting a health inspector through the after school day care area. I was very glad my shift was done at three and I was able to leave the whole situation at work again something I was unable to do a my previous job. well i need to go and get my kids back into bed for the umpteenth time. :) I' leave you with a current view of the Detroit Skyline.........,0,normal,blog_corpus,1703308.female.33.LawEnforcement-Security.Gemini,,,,,,0
