"So I'm only working part time this week, in order to ""prep for school""...that means I get off at noon everyday. Woo-hoo! In a few more days I will be done with that place for good! I'm actually ready for school to start...I even bought my books today, and reserved a locker at Gregory Gym. I want to get r-i-p-p-e-d. Is that so much to ask? This is the semester I'm gonna get my shit together. I swear. Today's highlights include: *A great chat with Braden, to whom I confessed my undying love and devotion. He took it in stride... *Shopping with Lena...but why the hell didn't I buy anything? *Hearing Jill's awesome, hott (that's hot with two Ts) story. That was good stuff. Tomorrow I'm going to see Outfoxed (if we get tickets) to learn about the evil ways of super-villain Rupert Murdoch. Then on Sunday I'm gonna see...Howard Dean! In person! How freaking exciting is that?* *Caution: level of dorkiness is ORANGE, or ""elevated.""",0,normal,blog_corpus,4110238.male.23.Student.Gemini,,,,,,0
