"ok so I know i should be in school right now, but i came home to get caught up on ALL my schoolwork b/c according to my mom...i socialze too much. but really can u socialize TOO much? i dont think its possible, but i gotta find that healthy balance of school-band-piano-social-boys...ugh its gonna be hard.. so he didnt ask me out yet...he told me its no fun if i know exactly when hes gonna do it which i think is stupid cuz he sayd he was gonna do it this week...guys, cant live with em and can't live without em...yeah if u agree let me know (just click the write comment button-cuz i like to feel loved and i feel loved when ppl write comments) yeah so I'm feelin kinda left out here cuz almost all my friends have bf's..but if u dont its ok cuz honestly i enjoy the single life much more because I'm what some ppl choose to call a flirt...but i mean as fun as that singleness is when u find a guy u really like, ur willin to give it up...for a while haha..yeah so John called me shallow today which in all honesty I think is rather rude if u ask me..i dont think he had a right to say that because in my opinion im not shallow...lauren is..and if ur not in our lunch group u wont get the lauren comment..dont worry..so yanks are only 1/2 a game behind right now, don't ask how its possible cuz i dont understand all i kno is they play tonight and if we win, and red sox lose...we'll be tied again for first in the division..yeah im a baseball freak i know but honestly guys in tight pants runnin around...u cant go wrong..I'd just like to remind all of u that my birthday is in two months and 20 days (august 1 for those of u who cant count) and my favorite flowers are stargazer lillies...yeah thats about all for today..i should be getting back to my homework..GO YANKS!! P.S. I made my mom dinner for mothers day last night..it was good, we had chicken and peach cobbler, stupid thing took me 3 hours...so if u ever want me to make dinner for u some weekend let me know and ill do it!! haha 