"goddess of laziness Its monday again and my laziness is starting again. I was supposed to go to school today to research* and finish checking my students' data sheets but I wanted to sleep all day. I feel so exhausted, tired and sleepy, so here i am. I've spent my weekend with my friends at Wewe's house for our long overdue DVD marathon. It gave me the taste of living with them albeit for a short period only. And i realized I'm not yet ready to live independently. My friends did all the cooking and cleaning stuff while all I could offer to do was buy Coke from the sari-sari store nearby. Since I got home from Wewe's place, I've been sleeping as if i slipped into a coma. I couldnt even command myself to write my ""things-to-do"" schedule for the week, or fix my schoolbag at the very least. I hope this is just a one-day debacle. -------------------- *research- anything that is related to my thesis and accomplishment thereof.",0,normal,blog_corpus,1290874.female.24.Non-Profit.Taurus,,,,,,0
