ow your still alive! * God gave me the chance to live ... i should live it according to His will! Alleluia! Praise the Lord! &nbsp; more to say!!!&nbsp; &nbsp; why have i been molded to the ways of last-minuteness??? i can't get to study until the last minute!!! i must try!! &nbsp; hanggang sa muli - paalam! song for the moment: lullabye &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;",0,normal,blog_corpus,3417868.female.13.Student.Taurus,,,,,,0
