"Hey, today is my mom's birthday, so I just wanted to wish her a happy birthday. I don't think anyone really knows how old she is because she has been lying about her age for as long as I can remember. I think she is thirty-something... ;-) Anyway, Happy Birthday Mom! I hope you have a great day! UPDATE: We went to eat at Golden Corral with my grandparents tonight for my mom's birthday. The people working there did a good job of embarrassing her by singing a song. When they asked how old she was, my mom just said, ""let's just say 39."" So the guy working at Golden Corral yelled to everyone that she is ""approximately 39 years old."" I thought that was pretty funny. My mom was really embarrassed. She continued to eat her food while they were singing to her. I think she was trying to pretend that it wasn't happening. There seemed to be a lot of people celebrating their birthdays at Golden Corral tonight. So to all those birthday people there, Happy Birthday!",0,normal,blog_corpus,658958.male.24.Communications-Media.Leo,,,,,,0
