"I just realized that there are only 4 months and a couple days left until, WE THE PEOPLE, can change this country for the better. ELECTION DAY IS NOVEMBER 2. ARE YOU REGISTERED TO VOTE? I know some of you think that your vote doesn't count, and that voting in another billionaire politician that knows nothing about the 'common' man won't make a big difference, and it may not, but exercise your right to choose. I know I sound idealistic and a bit like a commercial but really, I can't stand to see this country wasting young lives in the middle-east anymore. We need to stop poverty HERE and expand education before we go butting our noses into other people's problems. YES, we need to defend our country from terrorists and we need to stop them, but Mr. Bush can't prove the Iraq Al-Qaida connection, nor have we found weapons of mass destruction there. And what about the Patriot Act? Do we need our rights stripped from us more than they already have been? Ok I'm going to stop this rant now, but don't just sit there and remember, my opinion is mine, read up and form YOUR OWN opinions, and DO something about it. You only have 4 months left before we elect the person that's going to lead this country for the NEXT 4 years! www.johnkerry.com",0,normal,blog_corpus,3597680.female.25.indUnk.Leo,,,,,,0
