ew why he had said that. ugh...I remember being soo mad at him.&nbsp; So, Cruz and Jonny were both kinda retarded cuz they were both well, ya... that was pretty much my whole dream well ya anywayz back to my day: &nbsp;",0,normal,blog_corpus,3771643.female.14.indUnk.Scorpio,,,,,,0
