"Our landlord called over last night. As ever, his strong greek accent ensures you're never quite sure what he's saying... He's trying to sort out rent etc. for next year, as cam is also possibly planning to stay on next year and do a masters'. He also mentioned his plans for renovating the house. He plans to change the downstairs toilet (literally a room large enough for a toilet and nothing else, but which most disturbingly has a window in it... bizarre) into a spaceage shower unit which i cannot even begin to picture. He also plans on sticking a conservatory on the house, though where exactly i'm not sure. Wish he'd do up the kitchen. He also says that there's a girl who's moving out of college rooms at the end of the month, and she's going to be in one of his houses next year, but could she stay in our downstairs room for the rest of the term.. I'm not convinced this is a good idea, as i couldn't imagine the room being particularly comfortable or practicable - it's right beside the kitchen for one... Also we have enough fun with just the 1 shower with 5 of us, another cook would surely spoil the metaphorical broth. but sure we'll see what happens.",0,normal,blog_corpus,1833898.male.24.Science.Pisces,,,,,,0
