"In 6th grade Danny Kennedy told me he didn’t believe in God, he told me he was an atheist. I thought he was a heathen. So I did what any right-minded Christian would do. I asked my mother to take me to the Jesus Book & Gift Store , where I purchased the latest D.C. Talk cd and a Bible. The next day I tucked the Bible into Danny’s cubby with an inscription that read, “Jesus loves you.” He found the book and laughed. The Bible stayed untouched in his cubby for the rest of the school year and I put my efforts into “saving” other classmates. The Moral: Go see SAVED! It was fucking awesome and so so on it.",0,normal,blog_corpus,2627369.female.23.indUnk.Libra,,,,,,0
