"I haven't played any poker the last couple of days. I just haven't felt IT. Over the last month or so, I've been losing my ass. I can't seem to get a winning session together. I did have one a few days ago, but feel like it was more the cards being there than my play. I'm frustrated! I want to be a good player!! I don't feel like I'm getting anywhere. I study my hands, read books, try and put what I read into play, but I'm not moving forward. My bankroll hasn't moved in months. How do I move up in playing levels without putting more money in? I'm still playing .50/$1! I know...I'm whining. It's just that I want to move forward with my play, bankroll, level. When does it come together?",0,normal,blog_corpus,3121099.male.38.Tourism.Cancer,,,,,,0
