"Fingers &nbsp; Its as if my life's blood has been sucked straight from my marrow. Yes. I am being somewhat of a pissy baby but seriously, when you love someone that you completely lose yourself in.. it is all a lie, what do you do? &nbsp; I wish I knew what to do with myself. I honestly have no time to do anything other than keep busy with work, school and keeping myself to a fat-minimum. However, I find myself just staring into space thinking about him.. wondering if he is ever hoping that he will see me again. That I would trade everything to be with him. &nbsp; I sound like a babbling baby waiting for my mothers teet.. damn I hate being whiny. I detest those bitches. &nbsp; But how is it I feel so numb that I detach from everything that ever made me happy. I dont even want to go out, dance, socialize.. and drink? wtf? THATS my american pastime.",0,normal,blog_corpus,598986.female.25.indUnk.Sagittarius,,,,,,0
