"As I sit here, I ponder what someday means. I want to say is that someday I will be married and have kids. Our someday I will be done with school and this will happen this December, so maybe this is someday to me. After contemplating these, I am totally not going to not have this someday. So someday I hope that I am going to be working in Australia and be there with my family. This someday is not going to be your average day, for this day will be celebrated like it was the best day of my life. On this day it will be my best day for all my childhood dreams will have been meet and I will finally be doing something I love doing being a sales manager for one of the biggest companies in Australia. This day I will be packing and deciding what I am going to wear at my first day of work. My work will not be your everyday kind of job, it will be some high paying job that you will see me working in a three piece suit and I drive a Lexus. Someday can be anyway which ever you decide to make that someday. But a someday is really a goal that one sets in life that you are working for from a distance but then you get a break, our schooling pays off. If one never wonders about that someday, just look at what you’re doing now and think that aren’t you really working towards that someday in your life?",0,normal,blog_corpus,3732803.female.23.indUnk.Capricorn,,,,,,0
