"Requirement. Met up with a provision wrapped up in slush. Soaked and torn. Ink leaking the edges. Of a once remembered address. Raindrops. Satiated earth. Wind caught up in gusto. Leaves trying to erase the memory of dust. Dust trying to cling to its dear life. Remembrance. Nights of rain. Wrapped up in the arms of warmth. Passion trickling out of the windowsill. And into the local drain. Reality. Wind, Earth, Water. Evocation to a muse called fire. Lost in the midst of return. Realization trapped within parameters of dust.",0,normal,blog_corpus,3843387.female.25.Communications-Media.Capricorn,,,,,,0
