o remember so I might not post until thursday cause im going to a family reunion on monday till then so yeah. -Ryan ps, i bet kelsey and cassie are havin the time of their lives while all of us are sitting on our asses, lol",0,normal,blog_corpus,3424731.male.14.LawEnforcement-Security.Sagittarius,,,,,,0
