se myself ... Then back to Pasir Ris MRT ... Took back to Jurong East lohz ... While Amy alight at Lakeside ..I took 334 back but just now at MRT saw a very handsome guy .. He walk beside me and took the same bus as me .. But I alight first lahz ... lolx ... Went home found that no one was at home ... Then go wash those shirt and swim suit lohz ... Then came to blog le ... Quite a fun and ""memorable"" day .. lolx .... [.J.u.S.t.P.a.S.s.I.n.'.B.y.]Signed off at SGT-2240 Hrs",0,normal,blog_corpus,3503919.female.15.Student.Sagittarius,,,,,,0
