"The Greatest President I am sitting here watching former President Clinton speak live on C-SPAN. He is just amazing. He really knows what he is talking about and has deep thoughts (unlike some other people we know). I think that he was America's Greatest President. He brought a new hope to this country and optimism. He worked for the job, it wasn't handed to him. He was just a poor kid from Arkansas who grew up to be a 2-term President. It is moments like this when I hate term limits. ""There is nothing wrong with America that cannot be cured by what is right with America.""- President William Jefferson Clinton",0,normal,blog_corpus,2732859.male.15.Student.Virgo,,,,,,0
