"Yesterday my husband and I welcomed a new member to our little coven. A woman I met on the internet runs a Great Dane rescue and she stumbled accross three little Cocker Mix pups that got left behind, two boys and one girl, all three solid black. Growing up with a very simular mixed Cocker, I fell in love at first sight. She being the caring person she is took care of them including all their shots, first two vet appointments, worming, hartworm,and mico chipped them, before giving them to a good home. Well, yesterday we went and picked up ours! He is so sweet! I couldnt wait! I have been planning and waiting for a good time to buy a dog for over six years. I have been back and forth over which breed to purchase. I didnt want just any dog. As soon as I saw that face, I forgot about the expensive breeds I have been researching and had to have him. So far Max has been a wonderful addition to our family! A very smart, loving and easy going puppy!",0,normal,blog_corpus,1197361.female.34.indUnk.Taurus,,,,,,0
