"man havent written in a while, guess ive been too wrapped up in school and programming. not a good thing... been programming mainly websites, never can do to many of those. especially if you make good money off of them. couple hundred for an overnight project is not bad at all. my only source of income besides building computers and working for my dad's computer business. work has been slow for him, so im kind of hoping that he will get some business so we dont get into any problems or anything... on a brighter note, we had a lan party at school on friday . the third or fourth one for this year, it was good for the most part, until we had to get on the internet.... all me and a couple of friends wanted to do is just play wolfenstein enemy territory, but when armstrong found out he bout had a cow, or did he? he kicked worley out, and the rest of us guys left and went to mcdonalds, then back to worley's house to have our own lan party.... it was better than the one at school. mainly because we were allowed to use the internet to play the games, went good there, we played with d's clan, [kp] they're a pretty good group of guys... i was talking to them on ventrilo a voice chat program we use that runs in the background that lets us all talk to each other over the internet. [with pretty much no lag at all].... woke up the next morning and went to be blue man group concert which was one of the best experiences of my life. i totally reccommend it if you ever get the chance to go.... the ""appetizers"" as they called it [i refer to them as the people who arent as good as the other people so they have to open for somebody else] werent very good, but the intermission before blue man was awesome... i expected it to be lame but they had two of those little scrolling word signs that were arguing with each other and getting the audience to interact with them.. pretty cool, because it made the 15 min intermission go by really fast... i like that.... why cant all places do that, put out something that will entertain you while you are waiting to be entertained by the main group?? anyways thats off subject... back to the concert... who would of thought 3 dudes in blue paint banging on pvc would be an awesome musical group... not to mention the 5 drummers, 3 guitarist and the rest of the guys who plays with them... all in all the concert was good, and i really enjoy the music, my dad bought the cd and i have been listening to it non stop... partially because its an all out good cd... i totally recomend it, like i said above, i think.. dont remember, i think this is my longes ever blog... ill quit boring you now and go back to my cd, ah man i forgot i got to do laundry, oh well got to go for now but i will try and post every once an a while... [hopefully better than i have been] until next time... adios [c]",0,normal,blog_corpus,1992375.male.16.Communications-Media.Aquarius,,,,,,0
